  "post_content": "<p>El sainete &#39;Deixa&#39;m la dona Pepet&#39;, representado por el grupo &#39;El Cresol&#39; en el Teatro M&oacute;naco, ha puesfo fin la noche de este viernes al Mes del Voluntariado en Onda, cuyos actos se han venido desarrollando desde el 5 de diciembre.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/12/IMG_1706.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La entrada costaba tres euros y la recaudaci&oacute;n ha sido a beneficio de C&aacute;ritas Interparroquial de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1706.jpg\" alt=\"img_1706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1707.jpg\" alt=\"img_1707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1708.jpg\" alt=\"img_1708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1709.jpg\" alt=\"img_1709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1710.jpg\" alt=\"img_1710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1711.jpg\" alt=\"img_1711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1712.jpg\" alt=\"img_1712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sainetmesvoluntariat/img_1713.jpg\" alt=\"img_1713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
